{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>陳柏霖與女友庭瑄愛情長跑14年，感情始終低調穩定，去年更傳出男方在紐西蘭（新西蘭）浪漫求婚成功，原本計畫在當地舉辦小型婚禮，根據「鏡週刊」報導，近日又傳出兩人已悄悄登記結婚。</p><p>不過，消息曝光後，陳柏霖經紀人（經理人）則否認，表示「沒有這件事」，並強調若有好消息會再通知大家。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖傳已與14年長跑女友庭瑄秘密登記結婚。（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250709/1019564396772462592249510.png/e0TmlQBSJNkd_mprchPRohKmYb6Q8BDkAdQm2gHUJto\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖傳已與14年長跑女友庭瑄秘密登記結婚。（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250709/1019564404121276416823071.png/SGmF6l-kmiKykIz0gQQUOXcS4zAvbvT6p8MHgafDB4E\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250709/1019564394419326976984631.png/iWYzVHj-CvagcExVMDe_Y_LwtXLE-FagUZkl8VGZJfE\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638217097842688730298.jpeg/x7FgsLD2cjannBnLhDYl1gOjp9KTxQ2slRLDgJUSw4A\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638207899209728729814.jpeg/bnKyf-B-0Hy4ViRXTcXGkINlrc8yY8j2weG16MHhteg\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638213477765120548701.jpeg/dhfNtLHjDoGmETWYnWdMLpXAWAqG3nghpc8V6aXPFek\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638214543249408713546.jpeg/zQ56pZXpFItDKhQbusEoxIkdF7IUfIEwXrT29V609vU\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638207467196416316429.jpeg/SKpeqf-LnCdyCQdOaICHr1UMhqFv6BW_dInIXHSJyFw\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638209501564928079318.jpeg/wnspMUc_hQSXv-gr_BRKc6rObcP3WoE1gqY-E4KmPhM\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638215113805824425673.jpeg/1MMt-SgYSd3l5P3Af-WCWzWt5BYOzMUK_iRh4v4kYeI\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638209304301568730682.jpeg/m_QH6OF7YM3R-V8w_J3fP1rR-AY4b3ccfiZ9Jn4mfSY\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638216812498944580329.jpeg/TDMAqTaj1otnKCHWGacvgAz-TqaHCGVXNMTUzzTE1M8\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240209/832638210088636416740168.jpeg/E40Sw3L5amMwSqgEKvmGJRRwT3fM9GWy1vEVotbxFaI\"/><figcaption>庭萱（IG@hsuan900319）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250709/1019564400048345088975324.png/AJpoLe7Y8XHe09rCIBUF_0LbDSHJNc-6-Q0jj_kNI48\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250709/1019564403538137088429873.png/fNf1r8BgGarkaZzRv-G3iah1azOkyviXAoStfwKErX8\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240818/901788355141046272639412.jpeg/lVqC73Kn3Eru60-97i2KmDOxYdV4bykC0dp5KNHaeSg\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250709/1019564380238385152754219.png/pYpdozWzJcZBn926ha0zpcHTfeWrWhvT4D6SJuA-kiY\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240818/901788353131843584820196.jpeg/LZ-UzDUZAxcNOzqOoVv6tvttIhU5e-IZiy1TLIstUyw\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240818/901788354339672064530462.jpeg/ziW_2TE-UDv_a9edJes0pYMfLLFMW8w7rpqc066anNM\"/><figcaption>陳柏霖（IG@chenbolin）</figcaption></figure><p>陳柏霖與庭瑄交往多年，兩人鮮少公開放閃，卻早已融入彼此生活。據了解，庭瑄與陳家人關係相當親近，經常陪伴陳柏霖父母及妹妹聚餐、逛街，獲得長輩認可。兩人不僅感情穩定，也長期同居，生活中既是伴侶，也是彼此事業與人生的重要支持。</p><p>先前傳出陳柏霖去年5月帶著庭瑄前往紐西蘭旅遊，特別安排直升機行程，在雪地與峽灣美景中浪漫求婚，兩人隨後規劃在當地舉辦小型婚禮。不過，近日電影圈再傳出兩人因陳柏霖兵役問題，決定將人生大事轉趨低調，甚至已經完成結婚登記，但已遭到經紀人否認。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：台藝人逃兵役案｜陳柏霖修杰楷等人出事全多得他？網紅爆事情始末】周渝民。免役/服役狀況或原因：憂鬱症（申請三次免役獲准）（FB@周渝民）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231114/801068090926043136962481.jpeg/4vkm9JKwNqcOhzmA4AgRT0zizhpE_1Tpog4Mz6IODM8\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：台藝人逃兵役案｜陳柏霖修杰楷等人出事全多得他？網紅爆事情始末】周渝民。免役/服役狀況或原因：憂鬱症（申請三次免役獲准）（FB@周渝民）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Freddy（閃靈）。免役/服役狀況或原因：焦慮症（Instagram@freddylimtt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251021/1057326576938520576653812.jpeg/KCDa_R67iE4VddNTPO4BaR5dMC1urEP1Y0U3lGNFN5Q\"/><figcaption>Freddy（閃靈）。免役/服役狀況或原因：焦慮症（Instagram@freddylimtt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林佑威。免役/服役狀況或原因：甲狀腺低下（服役12天）（IG@goyowei）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956512281083514880392154.jpeg/mQQxoGg-ZL_9VAv9FTzhH4wrEWMlsp8L0JyGA9CchgM\"/><figcaption>林佑威。免役/服役狀況或原因：甲狀腺低下（服役12天）（IG@goyowei）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李威。免役/服役狀況或原因：僵直性脊椎炎（Instagram@elvanchien）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251021/1057327634674880512564280.jpeg/uGEpELGXf279cyWTeFDwZGnJA1UZEwfVNxIeJjcSHiY\"/><figcaption>李威。免役/服役狀況或原因：僵直性脊椎炎（Instagram@elvanchien）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周杰倫。免役/服役狀況或原因：僵直性脊椎炎（Instagram@jaychou）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251021/105732804473520537629